### Known limitations
- Cloudflare tunnel URL is ephemeral (session-scoped); for a permanent home the branch file works on any static host or file://.
- Audio is minimal WebAudio bleeps; muted until first user gesture (browser autoplay policy).
- Reference image 07 (pixel comet) is a stock/illustration source used for the trail concept only — all in-game art is original canvas code.
- Endless-route balancing (routes 5+) is lightly tuned; future polish could add themed palettes and more hazard patterns." 2>&1 | tail -n 3
